+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Category deletion now detaches products from the deleted category subtree without deleting products or their dependent cart/order data. Missing-category deletion is resolved using the current merchant store and returns 404 through the existing resource-not-found handling.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/catalog/category/CategoryServiceImpl.java` | modified | Removed product deletion from category cleanup; remove all subtree associations and update each product once. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/facade/category/CategoryFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Resolve DELETE target with `getById(categoryId, storeId)` so missing or cross-store categories are not treated as valid. |
+| `sm-shop/src/test/java/com/salesmanager/test/shop/integration/category/CategoryManagementAPIIntegrationTest.java` | modified | Added unknown-category DELETE 404 regression test. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- `CategoryManagementAPIIntegrationTest.deleteMissingCategoryReturnsNotFound` — verifies DELETE of an unknown category returns HTTP 404.
+
